  <conversation ID="Bep">
    <start>
      <choice ID="Vixy_TeachModMicroserrated" Target="Vixy_TaughtModMicroserrated" Ordinal="9700">
        <text>Your teeth are finer than my saw. Show me.</text>
        <part Name="Vixy_TeachMicroserrated" />
      </choice>
    </start>
    <node ID="Vixy_TaughtModMicroserrated">
      <text
      >Serration is teeth. Microserration is teeth on the teeth. Cut smaller, cut smaller, cut smaller - and then the flesh simply agrees to part.</text>
      <choice Target="Start">
        <text>Thank you, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=.</text>
      </choice>
    </node>
  </conversation>

