  <conversation ID="Q Girl">
    <start>
      <choice ID="Vixy_TeachModMassivelyOverloaded" Target="Vixy_TaughtModMassivelyOverloaded" Ordinal="9700">
        <text>How far past its rating can a cell actually be pushed?</text>
        <part Name="Vixy_TeachMassivelyOverloaded" />
      </choice>
    </start>
    <node ID="Vixy_TaughtModMassivelyOverloaded">
      <text
      >Further than the plate says. The plate is a promise to a customer, not a limit. Wind the regulator past its stop and hold your breath - it draws far more, and it will tell you when it disagrees.</text>
      <choice Target="Start">
        <text>Thank you, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=.</text>
      </choice>
    </node>
  </conversation>
